The indexation cap is statutory, the heating decision is brought forward to
November, and the shield is paid to households rather than announced at a
podium. The tenants' associations claim the win, correctly.

The bill is quarterly and permanent until somebody builds the homes that would
make it unnecessary. Our partners will raise that at every budget from now on,
and they will not be wrong.

- @poland_event_queue: Fund the shield

