The bill caps indexation at wage growth and does one other thing: it names the
week it was refused. The gallery is full of people whose leases are the
evidence.

We cannot cap a single rent from opposition. We can ensure that the next
increase arrives with a recorded vote attached to it.

- @poland_event_queue: Table the cap

@household_summit
title: Convene a housing summit
subtitle: Free. Everyone attends, nothing is indexed, and the organisers notice.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pressure_last_response = "Convened a summit";
