We stay on the parliamentary calendar. The march happens anyway.

By Sunday the recognisable faces in the footage are Konfederacja's, the demand
has been rewritten as a complaint about the state as such, and the tenants'
associations that called the protest are quoted in the ninth paragraph.

- @poland_event_queue: Let the march pass

@kpo_audit
# prose-audit: Grade B — The recovery-fund grievance is anchored in milestone verification, a payment request and the Commission's own procedure rather than a scrutiny score, and the responses separate what an opposition can audit from what a cabinet can actually repair.
title: The recovery money is audited instead of spent
subtitle: Unanswered scrutiny turns into a milestone dispute with the Commission
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 18
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and formation_in_progress = 0 and year >= 2021 and kpo_pressure_unmet >= 18 and pressure_top_domain = "kpo" and kpo_pressure_event_timer <= 0 and pressure_event_cooldown <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_pressure_event_timer = 10;
Q.pressure_event_cooldown = 3;
Q.pressure_events_resolved += 1;
Q.pressure_last_event = "Recovery-fund audit";
const leftExecutive = Q.left_in_government && Q.government_has_confidence &&
    !Q.caretaker_government;
if (leftExecutive) {
    Q.government_delivery -= 2;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 3;
} else {
    Q.government_delivery -= 3;
    Q.public_trust -= 1;
}
Q.eu_institutional_trust -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "Recovery-fund milestones fail verification and a payment slips";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — The milestone file comes back

The Commission's verification team does not reject the payment request. It does
something slower and more damaging: it returns it for clarification, twice,
over milestones that were reported as complete and are not — a competition
procedure that was never opened, an energy programme with money allocated and
no beneficiaries, a monitoring committee that has never met.

The questions have been asked often enough, and answered vaguely enough, that
the asking has itself become a story. The money is not lost. It is simply not
arriving, in the quarter it was budgeted to arrive, in the towns that already
put it in their own budgets.

- @kpo_beneficiary_register
- @kpo_repair_delivery
- @kpo_defend_government
- @kpo_let_it_run

@kpo_beneficiary_register
title: Publish the beneficiary register and the missing milestones
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Documented scrutiny that the Commission and the press can both use.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The research capacity for a register does not exist this month.
