Q.budget -= 1;
Q.kpo_scrutiny = Math.max(0, Q.kpo_scrutiny - 16);
Q.kpo_public_credit += 6;
Q.administrative_capacity += 3;
Q.government_delivery += 4;
Q.eu_institutional_trust += 4;
Q.administrative_reform_pressure =
    Math.max(0, Q.administrative_reform_pressure - 5);
Q.news_headline =
    "The competition procedures reopen and the payment request is resubmitted";
!}

The competitions are reopened with published criteria, the monitoring committee
meets with minutes, and the resubmitted request clears verification in the
following cycle.

None of it is visible to a voter. It is the difference between a recovery
programme and a press release about one.

- @poland_event_queue: Repair what we own

@kpo_defend_government
title: Defend the government's file in Brussels
subtitle: Free. Protects the coalition and the payment; the scrutiny simply stops being ours.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pressure_last_response = "Defended the government file";
Q.kpo_scrutiny = Math.max(0, Q.kpo_scrutiny - 3);
Q.eu_institutional_trust += 1;
Q.public_trust -= 2;
