@climate_energy_failure
# prose-audit: Grade B — The transition grievance is grounded in a heating-season tariff, an unbuilt grid connection and a named mining region rather than a capacity score, and the responses separate a funded programme from a just-transition bargain and from letting the bill land on households.
title: The transition arrives as a bill, not a plan
subtitle: Unanswered climate demands meet the heating season
