@justice_case_collapse
# prose-audit: Grade B — The accountability grievance is shown through a specific prosecution failure — a case reassigned twice, an expiring limitation period, an unexamined witness — rather than an oversight score, and the responses separate a statutory repair from parliamentary scrutiny and from letting impunity stand.
title: The case dies of procedure
subtitle: Unanswered accountability demands become a visible prosecution failure
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 18
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and formation_in_progress = 0 and justice_pressure_unmet >= 20 and pressure_top_domain = "justice" and justice_pressure_event_timer <= 0 and pressure_event_cooldown <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.justice_pressure_event_timer = 11;
Q.pressure_event_cooldown = 3;
