Assignment stops being discretionary, expert commissioning gets a funded
deadline, and the registry publishes case ages. The next file cannot die the
same way.

It is the least dramatic possible response to impunity, and the only one that
survives the next change of minister.

- @poland_event_queue: Fix the procedure

