!}

The document is dated, sourced and impossible to describe as a complaint: three
statutes, the offices that stopped them, the reasons given in writing and the
reasons given privately.

It buys clarity at the price of trust. Nobody in the Chancellery will send us
an early draft again, and the next negotiation opens with a partner that has
learned we publish.

